        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Hunt Prey"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nShaldar Falls-Far designates a single creature she can see and hear, or one that she's Tracking, as her prey. She gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to Seek the prey and to Survival checks to Track the prey. The first time she hits the designated prey in a round, she deals an additional 1d8 precision damage. She also ignores the penalty for making ranged attacks within her second range increment. These effects last until Shaldar Falls-Far uses Hunt Prey again."
            },
